OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies after crash with
OL,4,Aparked car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after the motorcycle he
OL,7,Fwas riding collided with a parked car
OL,8,Fin Smethwick.
OL,10,FThe rider, in his 20s, was found
OL,11,Fseriously injured on Foundry Lane,
OL,12,Fafter emergency services were called
OL,13,Fjust before 19:40 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FHe was confirmed dead at the scene,
OL,16,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said.
OL,18,FWest Midlands Police have appealed for
OL,19,Fwitnesses or anyone with dashcam
OL,20,Ffootage to contact the force as an
OL,21,Finvestigation into the crash continues.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
